      "content": "# Auto wiki \nA new feature for codx-junior where the AI maintains a wiki and support system to assist all team members: users and profiles.\n\nReview and document existing modules and endpoints for this. And generate a proposal for the auto wiki.\n\n## Expectations\nWe expect codx-junior to keep up to date user friendly documentation of the project.\nWe expect tools that can be used to access project knowledge.\nIt must manage child projects as well but each project will have it's own wiki/knowledge.\nWiki will work with vitepress documents by default but will be possible to choose others engines like mkdocs or other in the future, but now vitepress is enough.\n\n\n## What next\nCreate a clear summary of findings and proposal. We'll implement in an agile way from zero to hero.",
